{"3724910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Serene Estates: Last Guy", "steam_appid": 3724910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awaken in the Serene Estates, a vast underground housing facility built to shelter humanity from the dangers of the outside world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/73ea5e5879e46ba9172bb14a5fd2b2d1.poster.avif?t=1774517215\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/73ea5e5879e46ba9172bb14a5fd2b2d1.webm?t=1774517215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/73ea5e5879e46ba9172bb14a5fd2b2d1.mp4?t=1774517215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For generations, its residents have lived in controlled comfort, their lives guided and monitored by the omnipresent AI matron, Serena. Order was promised. Safety was guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something has gone wrong. You are <strong>D-5.Omega</strong>, one of the last conscious residents to awaken from a life spent inside the simulated dream of the Actuaverse. Small, fragile, and unprepared, you must now navigate a facility that has come alive in ways it should not have. Every corridor is watched, every system is armed, and Serena herself has marked you as an intruder.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Living Machine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serene Estates was built on security, and its systems will not let you go without a fight.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/da7093c7d902b949b7764b0ec7e497fc.avif?t=1774517215\" width=1200 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● <strong>Drones</strong> patrol the air, able to repair, maintain, and eliminate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● <strong>Security</strong> cameras are Serena’s eyes. Step into their vision and alarms, locks, and worse will follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● <strong>Turrets</strong> deploy automatically, shredding anything caught in their sights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● <strong>Hazards of the facility</strong> itself—electrified water, industrial fans, toxic gas, and endless shafts—turn the structure into a labyrinth of lethal design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/6d6adf3779fb6db3db8d5b101196c568.poster.avif?t=1774517215\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/6d6adf3779fb6db3db8d5b101196c568.webm?t=1774517215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/6d6adf3779fb6db3db8d5b101196c568.mp4?t=1774517215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tools of a Survivor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though frail, D-5.Omega is not powerless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Climb and traverse hidden routes to outmaneuver surveillance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Hack terminals to seize control of RC drones, turning Serena’s machines against her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Use energy cells to power up dormant systems, open locked paths, or manipulate the environment to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/e6d2f948cb1508a76a37cc8d81e6095c.poster.avif?t=1774517215\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/e6d2f948cb1508a76a37cc8d81e6095c.webm?t=1774517215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/e6d2f948cb1508a76a37cc8d81e6095c.mp4?t=1774517215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Items of Hope</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Soy Breeze vending machines keep you alive with a health boost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Bug Lite, rare and hidden, permanently expands your health pool when found and purchased with special tokens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Escape Keys unlock the pods of still-sleeping residents. Collect them all to rescue everyone and reach the best ending. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/a49cbd7153be87b3b720ac630ba10b71.avif?t=1774517215\" width=1200 height=388 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Atmospheric exploration through a colossal underground facility built on order and surveillance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Stealth and strategy to avoid cameras, alarms, and patrols</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Deadly hazards and enemies that force creative navigation and quick thinking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Hacking and drone control for indirect combat and puzzle solving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Lore-rich environments that reveal the unsettling truths behind Serene Estates, its corporate backers, and the Actuaverse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Multiple endings depending on how many you save or leave behind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/e936823208d808b2713c2ecd702bac0b.avif?t=1774517215\" width=1496 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Life inside Serene Estates was supposed to be safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Now the walls themselves have become a prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Will you escape Serena’s grasp, or be her last obedient resident?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/88f28643a5720151adddf6ca79eabf58.avif?t=1774517215\" width=1560 height=511 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Awaken in the Serene Estates, a vast underground housing facility built to shelter humanity from the dangers of the outside world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/73ea5e5879e46ba9172bb14a5fd2b2d1.poster.avif?t=1774517215\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/73ea5e5879e46ba9172bb14a5fd2b2d1.webm?t=1774517215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/73ea5e5879e46ba9172bb14a5fd2b2d1.mp4?t=1774517215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For generations, its residents have lived in controlled comfort, their lives guided and monitored by the omnipresent AI matron, Serena. Order was promised. Safety was guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something has gone wrong. You are <strong>D-5.Omega</strong>, one of the last conscious residents to awaken from a life spent inside the simulated dream of the Actuaverse. Small, fragile, and unprepared, you must now navigate a facility that has come alive in ways it should not have. Every corridor is watched, every system is armed, and Serena herself has marked you as an intruder.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Living Machine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serene Estates was built on security, and its systems will not let you go without a fight.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/da7093c7d902b949b7764b0ec7e497fc.avif?t=1774517215\" width=1200 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● <strong>Drones</strong> patrol the air, able to repair, maintain, and eliminate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● <strong>Security</strong> cameras are Serena’s eyes. Step into their vision and alarms, locks, and worse will follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● <strong>Turrets</strong> deploy automatically, shredding anything caught in their sights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● <strong>Hazards of the facility</strong> itself—electrified water, industrial fans, toxic gas, and endless shafts—turn the structure into a labyrinth of lethal design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/6d6adf3779fb6db3db8d5b101196c568.poster.avif?t=1774517215\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/6d6adf3779fb6db3db8d5b101196c568.webm?t=1774517215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/6d6adf3779fb6db3db8d5b101196c568.mp4?t=1774517215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tools of a Survivor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though frail, D-5.Omega is not powerless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Climb and traverse hidden routes to outmaneuver surveillance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Hack terminals to seize control of RC drones, turning Serena’s machines against her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Use energy cells to power up dormant systems, open locked paths, or manipulate the environment to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/e6d2f948cb1508a76a37cc8d81e6095c.poster.avif?t=1774517215\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/e6d2f948cb1508a76a37cc8d81e6095c.webm?t=1774517215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/e6d2f948cb1508a76a37cc8d81e6095c.mp4?t=1774517215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Items of Hope</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Soy Breeze vending machines keep you alive with a health boost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Bug Lite, rare and hidden, permanently expands your health pool when found and purchased with special tokens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Escape Keys unlock the pods of still-sleeping residents. Collect them all to rescue everyone and reach the best ending. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/a49cbd7153be87b3b720ac630ba10b71.avif?t=1774517215\" width=1200 height=388 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Atmospheric exploration through a colossal underground facility built on order and surveillance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Stealth and strategy to avoid cameras, alarms, and patrols</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Deadly hazards and enemies that force creative navigation and quick thinking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Hacking and drone control for indirect combat and puzzle solving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Lore-rich environments that reveal the unsettling truths behind Serene Estates, its corporate backers, and the Actuaverse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Multiple endings depending on how many you save or leave behind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/e936823208d808b2713c2ecd702bac0b.avif?t=1774517215\" width=1496 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Life inside Serene Estates was supposed to be safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Now the walls themselves have become a prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Will you escape Serena’s grasp, or be her last obedient resident?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/extras/88f28643a5720151adddf6ca79eabf58.avif?t=1774517215\" width=1560 height=511 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Step into Serene Estates: Last Guy, a 3D action-adventure inspired by the golden age of early 2000s classics. Explore a surreal housing complex where Y2K optimism meets abandoned brutalism. Hack robots, fight, and uncover the secrets of a system that keeps running long after humanity’s gone.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/efced7863a12cd584145d4d876fb491585c197bd/header.jpg?t=1774517215", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/cf5bf522e263b3cb97d042795920acb229db2d79/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774517215", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724910/cf5bf522e263b3cb97d042795920acb229db2d79/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774517215", "website": "https://kvltgames.com/start/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4700 2.40GH<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 765M<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 325 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mint<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4700 2.40GH<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 765M<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Proton or WINE required to run</li></ul>"}, "developers": ["Team Serene"], "publishers": ["Kvltgames"], "demos": [{"appid": 3752180, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial